INSERT INTO "pages" ("path","title","html","images","sort_order","updated_at") VALUES ('/event','행사홍보','<div class="original-layout original-event"><div class="original-row"><div class="original-col" data-original-span="10" style="flex:10 1 0%"><div class="original-row original-anchor-row"><div class="original-col" data-original-span="10" style="flex:10 1 0%"><span id="w202605148e33735098c4f"></span></div></div><div class="original-row"><div class="original-col" data-original-span="10" style="flex:10 1 0%"><div id="w202605049fc85206f3615"><section class="original-text"><div><div style="padding:28px 30px;padding-top:28px;padding-right:30px;padding-bottom:28px;padding-left:30px;margin:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;border:1px solid rgb(209, 213, 219);border-top:1px solid rgb(209, 213, 219);border-right:1px solid rgb(209, 213, 219);border-bottom:1px solid rgb(209, 213, 219);border-left:1px solid rgb(209, 213, 219);border-radius:10px;box-sizing:border-box;line-height:1.75;color:rgb(17, 24, 39);background:rgb(255, 255, 255);background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)"><div style="margin:0px 0px 14px;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:14px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.6;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:rgb(17, 24, 39)">정원과 ESG를 연결하는 다양한 현장을 공유합니다.</div><div style="margin:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px;line-height:1.75;font-size:16px;color:rgb(75, 85, 99)">포럼 및 파트너 기관의 행사, 교육, 세미나, 프로젝트를 홍보하고 참여를 연결합니다.</div></div></div></section></div></div></div><div class="original-row original-anchor-row"><div class="original-col" data-original-span="10" style="flex:10 1 0%"><span id="w2026051802a35ed4cd113"></span></div></div><div class="original-row original-anchor-row"><div class="original-col" data-original-span="10" style="flex:10 1 0%"><span id="w2026052189815e85cb8bd"></span></div></div></div></div></div><details class="legacy-content"><summary>기존 사이트 샘플 콘텐츠 원문 보기</summary><p>아래 영문 문구와 이미지는 개편 전 사이트에 있던 샘플 콘텐츠이며, 포럼의 실제 활동을 의미하지 않습니다.</p><div>&nbsp;<br>참여협력<br>지자체 협력<br>기업 협력<br>정책제안<br>행사홍보<br>정원과 ESG를 연결하는 다양한 현장을 공유합니다.<br>포럼 및 파트너 기관의 행사, 교육, 세미나, 프로젝트를 홍보하고 참여를 연결합니다.<br><br>A new project is an opportunity to create something unique.<br>We are a Creative Digital Agency based in Buenos Aires, Argentina. We take pride in designing and building...<br><br>We look forward to working with you on your next project<br>As an interdisciplinary agile team, our production process is flexible, collaborative, and adapts to each client’s needs<br><br>Style Tiles are always a good option to show work in progress!<br>We are working on the UX/UI design for a large hotel owners and hospitality management company.<br><br>Hey! Recently we were working on a project for ..<br>We design and build digital products people enjoy using...<br><br>A new project is an opportunity to create something unique.<br>We are a Creative Digital Agency based in Buenos Aires, Argentina. We take pride in designing and building...<br><br>We look forward to working with you on your next project<br>As an interdisciplinary agile team, our production process is flexible, collaborative, and adapts to each client’s needs<br><br>Style Tiles are always a good option to show work in progress!<br>We are working on the UX/UI design for a large hotel owners and hospitality management company.<br><br>You can check the attachment for a full view..<br>More shots with final designs coming soon.<br><br>This is a proposal to add value to a crowdfunding listing page<br>we streamline the process without having to make multiple mockups.<br><br>Clients easily understand them<br>Style tiles serve as a flexible starting point that helps us easily communicate the essence of a visual brand for the web.<br><br>we have a lot of fun during this phase.<br>We are working on an exciting project for a company in the investment business. Stay tuned!<br><br>Hey! Recently we were working on a project for ..<br>We design and build digital products people enjoy using...<br><br>A new project is an opportunity to create something unique.<br>We are a Creative Digital Agency based in Buenos Aires, Argentina. We take pride in designing and building...<br><br>We look forward to working with you on your next project<br>As an interdisciplinary agile team, our production process is flexible, collaborative, and adapts to each client’s needs<br><br>Style Tiles are always a good option to show work in progress!<br>We are working on the UX/UI design for a large hotel owners and hospitality management company.<br><br>You can check the attachment for a full view..<br>More shots with final designs coming soon.<br><br>This is a proposal to add value to a crowdfunding listing page<br>we streamline the process without having to make multiple mockups.<br><br>Clients easily understand them<br>Style tiles serve as a flexible starting point that helps us easily communicate the essence of a visual brand for the web.<br><br>we have a lot of fun during this phase.<br>We are working on an exciting project for a company in the investment business. Stay tuned!<br><br>Hey! Recently we were working on a project for ..<br>We design and build digital products people enjoy using...<br><br>A new project is an opportunity to create something unique.<br>We are a Creative Digital Agency based in Buenos Aires, Argentina. We take pride in designing and building...<br><br>We look forward to working with you on your next project<br>As an interdisciplinary agile team, our production process is flexible, collaborative, and adapts to each client’s needs<br><br>Style Tiles are always a good option to show work in progress!<br>We are working on the UX/UI design for a large hotel owners and hospitality management company.<br><br>Hey! Recently we were working on a project for ..<br>We design and build digital products people enjoy using...<br><br>A new project is an opportunity to create something unique.<br>We are a Creative Digital Agency based in Buenos Aires, Argentina. We take pride in designing and building...<br><br>We look forward to working with you on your next project<br>As an interdisciplinary agile team, our production process is flexible, collaborative, and adapts to each client’s needs<br><br>월<br>주<br>일<br>2026년 11월<br>일	월	화	수	목	금	토<br><br><br>						<br>1	2	3	4	5	6	7<br>						<br>						<br>8	9	10	11	12	13	14<br>						<br>						<br>15	16	17	18	19	20	21<br>						<br>						<br>22	23	24	25	26	27	28<br>						<br>						<br>29	30	1	2	3	4	5<br>						<br>						<br>6	7	8	9	10	11	12<br>						</div><div class="legacy-images"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/5833d3f9a65f7.jpg" alt="기존 사이트 샘플 이미지"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/5833d3f9cef13.jpg" alt="기존 사이트 샘플 이미지"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/5833d3f9f1d54.jpg" alt="기존 사이트 샘플 이미지"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/5833a974c1f1e.jpg" alt="기존 사이트 샘플 이미지"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/5833a97514ec6.jpg" alt="기존 사이트 샘플 이미지"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/5833a9754b679.jpg" alt="기존 사이트 샘플 이미지"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/5833a9756e124.jpg" alt="기존 사이트 샘플 이미지"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/5833a975a8280.jpg" alt="기존 사이트 샘플 이미지"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/5833a975e42d4.jpg" alt="기존 사이트 샘플 이미지"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/5833aa7be874c.jpg" alt="기존 사이트 샘플 이미지"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/5833aa7c32db5.jpg" alt="기존 사이트 샘플 이미지"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/5833aa7c5d1fe.jpg" alt="기존 사이트 샘플 이미지"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/5833ae15b7532.jpg" alt="기존 사이트 샘플 이미지"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/5833ae16049bb.jpg" alt="기존 사이트 샘플 이미지"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/5833ae1635c9c.jpg" alt="기존 사이트 샘플 이미지"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/5833d3f87db83.jpg" alt="기존 사이트 샘플 이미지"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/5833d3f8b193d.jpg" alt="기존 사이트 샘플 이미지"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/5833d3f913c60.jpg" alt="기존 사이트 샘플 이미지"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/5833d3f945ecb.jpg" alt="기존 사이트 샘플 이미지"><img loading="lazy" src="/asse